# The backend's origin, read by `src/lib/dashboardClient.ts` only to name it in an "unreachable
# backend" error message — the transport itself calls relative paths, proxied to the real backend by
# `vite.config.ts` locally and by whatever serves this build in production (see
# `docs/multi-tenant-auth.md`, ADR-0001). Leave unset locally; set to the real deployed backend's
# origin in a production build.
VITE_BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5391
